      "section_id": "kohler-volume-2:p0395-p0400:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                             Krameria triandra Ruiz et Pavon.\n\n            Echte Ratanhia         (Ratanha),        Peru-Payta-rothe        Ratanhia      —     Ratanhia    —\n                                                    Rhatany, Krameria.\n\n            Familie:    Caesalpiniaceae       (Polygonaceae nach Bentham und Hooker;                Gattung:     Krameria\nLoefling.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "學名Krameria triandra，別名Echte Ratanhia。隸屬Caesalpiniaceae科，Krameria屬。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "source_id": "kohler-volume-2",
